<%#
# Key: subagents/tools/send/description
# Purpose: Subagent follow-up Tool description.
# Used: Included in a Tool or Tool-input specification shown to the model as the subagent follow-up Tool description.
# Locals:
# - None.
# Constraints:
# - Must render non-blank.
-%>
Send a follow-up turn to an existing active or persisted subagent identity. Persisted conversations are restored before the follow-up. Messages are processed in order after the current turn and do not interject active work. For status, steering, stopping, or finalization of active work, use interject_subagent. Sync mode waits for the later response; async mode enqueues the turn and returns immediately.
